23, "avatar": "c1c11c3caf066c12234a6ec6340df25f61a768c9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dont Shoot", "timestamp_created": 1773618032, "timestamp_updated": 1773618032, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220786589", "author": {"steamid": "76561199842356146", "personaname": "King_Deraj", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199842356146/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 1132, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 340, "last_played": 1775441109, "avatar": "a611079b54e28dedc774c60c60680ac10f50a9b3"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game at its core is a good game in my opinion. On the other hand whenever you're just trying to kill a big Arc enemy and some nutless raiders comes behind you with a shotgun whenever you already expressed that you are a friendly just going for the arc enemy. Really really ruins this game for me. Take PVP out of this game it has completely taken any love that i had for this game and burned it away. Just bought it for my pc swapped from ps5 and honestly i regret ever buying this game again. Take out the pvp, make a pvp only server for these toxic psses to play on.", "timestamp_created": 1773618004, "timestamp_updated": 1773618004, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "220786554", "author": {"steamid": "76561199087705166", "personaname": "Tyler.DMA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tyler_DMA/", "num_games_owned": 16, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4005, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3563, "last_played": 1775740189, "avatar": "c9f880f4bff4cf02ca95229c63e00970042d69b7"}, "language": "english", "review": "great game", "timestamp_created": 1773617970, "timestamp_updated": 1773617970, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220786381", "author": {"steamid": "76561198339830565", "personaname": "Luuchaa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Luuchaa/", "num_games_owned": 43, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 31730, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19431, "last_played": 1777678287, "avatar": "f19400a6a59886c75cd0af46baa71bbacf7b6844"}, "language": "english", "review": "If these useless developers would just watch one match of PvP lobbies, they would understand that the best solution would be to buff the trigger grenade so it can one-shot players. Right now it’s way too weak — I have to throw two triggers just to wipe an entire team. I think making it one-shot would be much better. <3", "timestamp_created": 1773617790, "timestamp_updated": 1773617790, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220786020", "author": {"steamid": "76561198735162684", "personaname": "wesleyiscool54321@bandit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198735162684/", "num_games_owned": 4, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 5005, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4800, "last_played": 1774650731, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "i got like hella money", "timestamp_created": 1773617381, "timestamp_updated": 1773617381, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220786008", "author": {"steamid": "76561199011659932", "personaname": "SPQR_REN", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199011659932/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 9611, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9601, "last_played": 1773775219, "avatar": "3f47c3634c822270cbccf23f4cb4fcf2272e23d1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lets start with saying this game at the core is very good one of if not the best the world feels good the AI feel fun to fight, but oh my god the last second decision to add pvp was such a mistake. This game when you look at the players the poles what people want over 70% dont want pvp they just want to have fun in pve. The community has been screaming for a pve mode so casual players that actually have a job can have fun after work or play it casually. I myself hate this aggresion matchmaking because then you get these people that will abuse it and purposley be put in easy pve/frendlier lobbies just to shoot frendliy people in the back of the head. In this current state i would not reccommend buying it, i so despratley want to love this game but the players constantly shooting you in the back of the head after saying there friendly is making me just go play a deticated pvp only game or pve only game. If embark would listen to the majority of there player base and add a pve only mode and leave pvpve as the default mode it would soar in player count. Also as a side note embark activley giving cheaters a second chance is beyond me, just ban them outright dont give them mutiple chances to cheat.", "timestamp_created": 1773617368, "timestamp_updated": 1773617368, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "hardware": {"system_ram": "63134", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT", "vram_size": 16337}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220785957", "author": {"steamid": "76561198014327481", "personaname": "Donald Trump", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/a234k234k2/", "num_games_owned": 210, "num_reviews": 107, "playtime_forever": 306, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 291, "last_played": 1773617340, "avatar": "0e17b06093f2c278371acb0b386e8a5d4f9b1a11"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's okay. I bought it after reading that the arc's are trained on machine learning from user playback data. \r\n\r\nI didn't really find the ARC AI that interesting. \r\n\r\nMaps have relatively low player count. I lost interest after a few hours, despite my playtime showing 46 hours the game was running in the background during this time.", "timestamp_created": 1773617312, "timestamp_updated": 1773617312, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reaction